     /// The compaction a session runs, on its own as the context fills and
-    /// when the app asks: kwwk's defaults, with this in front of its native
-    /// compaction.
+    /// when the app asks: this in front of kwwk's native compaction, and
+    /// kwwk's own numbers tightened.
+    ///
+    /// A chat that fills up fails with "compaction left <n> tokens, above the
+    /// recovery target of <m>". The target is
+    /// `window × threshold × recoveryRatio`, so on a 128k window with kwwk's
+    /// defaults it is 131072 × 0.75 × 0.8 = 78643 — and the summary a long
+    /// session produces lands well above that. kwwk retries by shrinking the
+    /// recent tail and giving up after `maxSummaryAttempts` (2), which is not
+    /// enough attempts to walk a large transcript down to the target:
+    ///
+    /// - `maxSummaryAttempts` 8, so the tail keeps halving instead of the
+    ///   third attempt never happening. `maxSummaryAttempts` is capped in
+    ///   effect by the tail reaching one message, so the extra attempts cost
+    ///   nothing once the plan stops moving.
+    /// - `recoveryRatio` 0.95, which lifts the target to 93388 on the same
+    ///   window — still under `AgentRequestBudget.inputTokens` (98304), so
+    ///   the summary that comes back is one the provider will accept.
+    /// - `keepRecentTokens` 6000, so the first attempt starts closer to the
+    ///   answer rather than spending an attempt on a 20000-token tail.
+    /// - `summaryWordTarget` 600, so each recap is shorter to begin with.
+    ///
+    /// None of these change what a summary is: they change how hard the
+    /// compactor tries and where it aims. The transcript still ends up with
+    /// a recap plus the recent tail, and a session that fits is untouched.
     static var configuration: AgentContextCompactionConfig {
-        AgentContextCompactionConfig(nativeCompaction: compact())
+        AgentContextCompactionConfig(
+            summaryWordTarget: 600,
+            keepRecentTokens: 6_000,
+            recoveryRatio: 0.95,
+            maxSummaryAttempts: 8,
+            nativeCompaction: compact(),
+        )
     }
